    - "// @input AssignableType_3 keyboard {\"hint\":\"Systems/KeyboardInput. Scenario 'keyboard' calls its submit() directly — the same method the return key calls — rather than emitting userRequest itself. Emitting the event would only prove the engine handles the event; this proves the KEYBOARD reaches it.\"}"
